    # `promotions`, every drop ALDI has announced with its themes. `mode=product&product=`
    # returns `product` with those fields and `description`, `ingredients`, `allergens`,
    # `claims`, `storage`, `usage`, `countryOfOrigin` and `images`. Prices are ALDI's in-store
    # prices in AUD (ALDI Australia does not sell groceries online). Listings collect up to
