    # `priceRange`, `categories`, `address`, `neighborhoods`, `url`, `businessId`, `image` and
    # `isAd`. Filter with `sort`, `price` (1-4) and `open_now`, and collect up to `max_results`
    # across pages. **Detail** (`mode=detail`): give a business `url` and get a rich object -
